    "summary": {
      "value": "Gain several benefits from Dodge and Stolen Time."
    },
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> you must have mastered <strong>Entropist</strong> or <strong>Rogue</strong>, and must have acquired one or more Skills among <strong>Dodge</strong> and <strong>Stolen Time</strong>.</p><hr><p>You gain a bonus to your Initiative modiﬁer equal to <strong>【your SL in Dodge + your SL in Stolen Time】</strong>.</p><p>As long as you have <strong>no shield</strong> and <strong>no martial armor</strong> equipped, all damage you suffer is reduced by an amount equal to <strong>【your SL in Dodge】</strong> (applied <strong>before</strong> damage Afﬁnities) and you deal extra damage equal to <strong>【your SL in Stolen Time】</strong>.</p>",
